      "sc:description": "TARPON is a best-practices Nextflow pipeline for analyzing telomeres sequenced on the Oxford Nanopore Technologies (ONT) platform. It is designed for analyzing chromosome arm-specific telomere lengths in both model organisms and humans, optimized for diagnostic workflows.",
